Companion software notice (not part of the MIT terms above):

This module is the Android/phon-side half of the TB-net wire-uplink feature.
The other half — the Gauge macOS app and its TBNetBridge plugin — is
distributed separately and is not covered by this license. Download it from:

  https://secondsee.com/downloads/gauge

Run the gauge host with the TBNetBridge plugin on the macOS machine that
gateways the wire, then install this module on the rooted Android phone that
rides it. Both halves are required for the feature to work end to end.